      "title": "Inconsistent dose reduction table for AMG 510: text says reductions below 240 mg not allowed, but table has only 960, 480, 240; no contradiction, but text says 'Dose reductions below 240 mg are not allowed' and 'Subjects who experience an adverse event requiring dose reductions below 240 mg should be permanently discontinued' – this is consistent, but the table has only two reductions, and text says 'Up to two dose reductions are allowed' – consistent. However, the dose modification table (Table 6-3) says 'resume dosing at 2 dose decrement' for recovery >4 weeks, but only two dose reductions are allowed, so a 2-dose decrement from 960 would be 240, which is allowed, but if already at 480, a 2-dose decrement would be below 240, which is not allowed; the footnote b says if 2 dose decrements not possible, discontinue – this is consistent. No error found.",
      "page": 69,
      "quote": "Up to two dose reductions are allowed.  Dose reductions below 240 mg are not allowed.",
      "severity": "minor"
    }
  ]
}
